<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:03]<b>1</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:06]What are you going to do this year?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:08]<b>2</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:10]I want to work in a restaurant as a chef.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:14]<b>3</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:16]I’m going to get a job as a waiter in October.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:21]<b>4</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:22.5]I’d like to speak English better because I want to work abroad.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:28]<b>5</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:30]I’m going to get a place at college to learn about hotel management.</p>]]></text>
